  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add a tickbox in the settings for \"Hide avatar worlds in menu\"\nI'm sure there's a good number of users (myself included) who have no need for them and don't want them cluttering up their menu.\nIt would also help significantly in the world discovery process as with such an option.\n\nIt should be an opt-in setting, with the default being to show them.",
